          <td><span class="badge ${e.status === "active" ? "badge-active" : "badge-revoked"}">${esc(e.status)}</span></td>
        </tr>`).join("")}
      </table>` : '<div style="color:#555">No estates configured</div>'}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── RATE TABLE ── -->
