/**
 * GABRIEL MCP Server v2.0.0 — UPGRADED
 * Exposes GABRIEL AI Orchestration Layer + Empire Status + Beast Pipeline
 *
 * New in v2.0:
 *   gabriel_dispatch    — Dispatch task to specific named agent
